# gate fails if one is ever tracked.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/
tools/ffmpeg-sidecar/dist/

# Media test corpus — CLAUDE.md forbidden behaviour 12. Binary blobs in git
# history are permanent. The corpus is fetched or generated, never committed.
# Anchored: `tools/corpus/` is the generator, and it is committed.
/corpus/
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.m4a
*.wav

# Secrets — CLAUDE.md section 11. The updater signing key lives in GitHub
# Actions secrets. A key pushed once is a key that must be rotated.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
tauri-updater.key*

